# Bard Necro PvP loop: keep the buffs and potions up, follow the player you last targeted, Explosion into Energy Bolt, a bomb when a telekinesis is on them.
# Needs: hotkeys "> Smart Heal/Cure Self", "Cancel Current Target", "Target Self", "Pouch", "Drink Heal", "Drink Cure", "Drink Explosion", "Drink Strength", "Drink Agility", "Drink Magic Resist", "Eat Magic Mushroom". Cooldown bars "heal pot", "reflect", "explo pot", "teleki, me", "teleki, target".
#
# Conventions are bard-necro-enhanced's: names, overheads, the act window, the cast poll shape.
# What is different, and why:
#   The target is only ever what you last targeted, by Q, Shift+X/C, or C and a click. Nothing
#   is picked up on its own, and a blue is left alone unless config__attack_blue says otherwise.
#   No songs, no bard skills, no necro abilities, no Grimoire procs, no Curse, no Mana Drain:
#   against a player none of them is worth the cast, and the necro ones do nothing at all.
#   Explosion is cast ahead of time and its cursor held until the target is inside
#   config__pvp_range. Then Energy Bolt follows at once: Explosion lands 2.5 seconds after the
#   target, Energy Bolt 1.95 seconds of cast plus 0.5 later, so the two hit together.
#   Telekinesis is one cast per 30 seconds per caster, self or enemy. The first goes on self
#   unless the enemy already stuck one on us, the next goes on the enemy and opens the bomb.
# Not for structured PvP or factions: there find, timers and player serials are restricted.
clearall
clearsysmsg
cleardragdrop
clearignore

# ####################################################################################
# # CONFIG
# ####################################################################################
# 1 narrates target changes and the held Explosion, 0 keeps it quiet.
@setvar! config__chatty 1

# Spells reach 12 tiles. Two tiles of margin for a target that is moving away.
@setvar! config__pvp_range 10

# How far the target may be and still be worth arming an Explosion for.
@setvar! config__sight_range 18

# 1 lets a blue you targeted be attacked. 0 ignores blues, a wrong click on one is two minutes
# of criminal.
@setvar! config__attack_blue 0

# 1 spends the first telekinesis on self, so no potion sticks to us for 30 seconds. 0 goes
# straight for the enemy.
@setvar! config__use_self_tk 1

# 1 throws an explosion potion at the target while our telekinesis is on them.
@setvar! config__use_bomb 1

# Hit points below maximum that drink a heal potion, and that drop a held cursor for a cast
# heal. The potion first: it cannot be interrupted, a heal cast can. A greater heal potion
# restores around thirty, so drinking earlier than this wastes part of it.
@setvar! config__heal_hits 35
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 45

# Explosion plus Energy Bolt. Below this the loop waits for mana rather than half a dump.
@setvar! config__dump_mana 40
@setvar! config__mana_6th 20
@setvar! config__mushroom_eat_mana 45

# ####################################################################################
# # WAIT AND COOLDOWN
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! wait__short 200
@setvar! wait__poll 100
@setvar! wait__target 1000
@setvar! wait__cast 300
@setvar! wait__message 400

# Telekinesis: at most one successful cast on any player every 30 seconds, self included.
@setvar! cooldown__tk 30500
@setvar! cooldown__heal_potion 10000
@setvar! cooldown__cure_retry 3000
@setvar! cooldown__stat_potion 125000
# How often the followers are pointed at the target again.
@setvar! cooldown__pets 15000
# How long a held Explosion cursor waits for the target to come into range.
@setvar! cooldown__arm 20000
@setvar! cooldown__message 2000

# ####################################################################################
# # STATE
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! var__target 0
@setvar! var__engaged 0
@setvar! var__in_range 0
@setvar! var__armed 0
@setvar! var__self_tk_done 0
@setvar! var__fresh_ok 0

if not timerexists "timer__tk"
    createtimer "timer__tk"
    settimer "timer__tk" cooldown__tk
endif

if not timerexists "timer__pets"
    createtimer "timer__pets"
    settimer "timer__pets" cooldown__pets
endif

if not timerexists "timer__arm"
    createtimer "timer__arm"
    settimer "timer__arm" 0
endif

if not timerexists "timer__cure"
    createtimer "timer__cure"
    settimer "timer__cure" cooldown__cure_retry
endif

if not timerexists "timer__strength"
    createtimer "timer__strength"
    settimer "timer__strength" cooldown__stat_potion
endif

if not timerexists "timer__agility"
    createtimer "timer__agility"
    settimer "timer__agility" cooldown__stat_potion
endif

if not timerexists "timer__message"
    createtimer "timer__message"
    settimer "timer__message" cooldown__message
endif

overhead "[ pvp, on ]" 90

while not dead
    # ####################################################################################
    # # TARGET
    # ####################################################################################
    # Only what you last targeted, and only players by notoriety. Read every pass so a Q
    # mid fight moves the whole loop from the next cast on.
    if find lasttarget ground -1 -1 config__sight_range as alias__fresh_target
        if not dead alias__fresh_target and var__target != alias__fresh_target
            @setvar! var__fresh_ok 0

            if noto alias__fresh_target = "murderer" or noto alias__fresh_target = "criminal" or noto alias__fresh_target = "enemy" or noto alias__fresh_target = "hostile"
                @setvar! var__fresh_ok 1
            endif

            if config__attack_blue = 1 and noto alias__fresh_target = "innocent"
                @setvar! var__fresh_ok 1
            endif

            if var__fresh_ok = 1
                @setvar! var__target alias__fresh_target
                @setvar! var__self_tk_done 0
                settimer "timer__pets" cooldown__pets

                if config__chatty = 1
                    overhead "[ target, set ]" 90
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    @setvar! var__engaged 0
    @setvar! var__in_range 0

    if find var__target ground -1 -1 config__sight_range as alias__target
        if dead alias__target
            @setvar! var__target 0
        else
            @setvar! var__engaged 1

            if find var__target ground -1 -1 config__pvp_range as alias__near_target
                @setvar! var__in_range 1
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # PASS FLAGS
    # ####################################################################################
    #   reactive armor  garlic, spider silk, sulfurous ash
    #   reflection      garlic, mandrake root, spider silk
    #   telekinesis     bloodmoss, mandrake root
    #   explosion       black pearl, mandrake root, nightshade
    #   energy bolt     black pearl, nightshade
    @setvar! var__regs_reactive 0
    @setvar! var__regs_reflect 0
    @setvar! var__regs_tk 0
    @setvar! var__regs_explo 0
    @setvar! var__regs_eb 0

    if findtype 3972 self and findtype 3981 self and findtype 3980 self
        @setvar! var__regs_reactive 1
    endif

    if findtype 3972 self and findtype 3974 self and findtype 3981 self
        @setvar! var__regs_reflect 1
    endif

    if findtype 3963 self and findtype 3974 self
        @setvar! var__regs_tk 1
    endif

    if findtype 3962 self and findtype 3974 self and findtype 3976 self
        @setvar! var__regs_explo 1
    endif

    if findtype 3962 self and findtype 3976 self
        @setvar! var__regs_eb 1
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # SURVIVAL
    # ####################################################################################
    # Potions and the pouch need no cursor and no cast, so they run even while an Explosion
    # cursor is held. A cast heal has to drop that cursor first.
    if paralyzed
        hotkey 'Pouch'
        wait wait__short
    endif

    if poisoned and timer "timer__cure" >= cooldown__cure_retry
        hotkey 'Drink Cure'
        settimer "timer__cure" 0
        wait wait__short
    endif

    if diffhits >= config__heal_hits and cooldown "heal pot" = 0
        hotkey 'Drink Heal'
        cooldown "heal pot" cooldown__heal_potion
        wait wait__short
    elseif diffhits >= config__emergency_hits and not casting
        if targetexists
            hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
            @setvar! var__armed 0
            wait wait__short
        endif

        hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
        wait wait__short

        for 25
            if not casting
                break
            endif

            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                break
            endif

            wait wait__poll
        endfor
    endif

    if mana <= config__mushroom_eat_mana and not findbuff 'Magic Mushroom Cooldown' and findtype "mushroom" backpack
        hotkey 'Eat Magic Mushroom'
        wait wait__short
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # KEEP
    # ####################################################################################
    # Reactive Armor and Magic Reflection whenever they are down, the stat potions on their own
    # clock. Reflection outranks the dump: fourteen mana that eats one of their spells.
    # Casts wait for the feet to stop, a step breaks them.
    if not targetexists and not casting and cooldown "walk" = 0
        if not findbuff 'Reactive Armor' and var__regs_reactive = 1 and mana >= 4
            cast 'Reactive Armor'
            wait wait__short

            for 25
                if not casting
                    break
                endif

                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif

                wait wait__poll
            endfor
        elseif not findbuff 'Magic Reflection' and cooldown "reflect" = 0 and var__regs_reflect = 1 and mana >= 14
            cast 'Magic Reflection'
            wait wait__short

            for 25
                if not casting
                    break
                endif

                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif

                wait wait__poll
            endfor
        endif
    endif

    if timer "timer__strength" >= cooldown__stat_potion
        hotkey 'Drink Strength'
        settimer "timer__strength" 0
        wait wait__short
    endif

    if timer "timer__agility" >= cooldown__stat_potion
        hotkey 'Drink Agility'
        settimer "timer__agility" 0
        wait wait__short
    endif

    if not findbuff 'Magic Resist Potion' and findtype "Black Potion" backpack
        hotkey 'Drink Magic Resist'
        wait wait__short
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # PETS
    # ####################################################################################
    # Only with followers out, and only standing: the command opens a cursor, and answering
    # it mid step is what kept firing on the move.
    if var__engaged = 1 and followers > 0 and timer "timer__pets" >= cooldown__pets
        if not targetexists and not casting and cooldown "walk" = 0
            say 'all kill'
            waitfortarget wait__target

            if targetexists
                target var__target
                settimer "timer__pets" 0
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # TELEKINESIS
    # ####################################################################################
    # One cast per 30 seconds, whoever it goes on. Self first, unless the enemy already stuck
    # one on us, in which case ours would not land and the enemy gets it straight away.
    if var__engaged = 1 and timer "timer__tk" >= cooldown__tk and var__regs_tk = 1 and mana >= 9
        if not targetexists and not casting and cooldown "walk" = 0
            if cooldown "teleki, me" > 0
                @setvar! var__self_tk_done 1
            endif

            if config__use_self_tk = 1 and var__self_tk_done = 0
                cast 'Telekinesis'

                for 25
                    if targetexists
                        break
                    endif

                    if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                        break
                    endif

                    wait wait__poll
                endfor

                if targetexists
                    hotkey 'Target Self'
                    settimer "timer__tk" 0
                    @setvar! var__self_tk_done 1
                    wait wait__cast
                endif
            elseif var__in_range = 1 and cooldown "teleki, target" = 0
                cast 'Telekinesis'

                for 25
                    if targetexists
                        break
                    endif

                    if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                        break
                    endif

                    wait wait__poll
                endfor

                if targetexists
                    target var__target
                    settimer "timer__tk" 0
                    wait wait__cast
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # BOMB
    # ####################################################################################
    # Only while our telekinesis is on them: a potion that does not stick is walked away from.
    # The five second fuse starts on the drink, not the throw, and the cursor has to be
    # answered inside it or the potion goes off in hand. Thrown right before the dump, so the
    # fuse ends as Explosion and Energy Bolt land: drink at t, Explosion delivered at t+2.3
    # lands at t+4.8, Energy Bolt cast then lands at t+4.75, potion at t+5.
    if config__use_bomb = 1 and var__in_range = 1 and cooldown "teleki, target" > 0 and cooldown "explo pot" = 0
        if not targetexists and not casting and var__armed = 0 and mana >= config__dump_mana
            hotkey 'Drink Explosion'
            waitfortarget wait__target

            if targetexists
                target var__target
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # DUMP
    # ####################################################################################
    # Arm: cast Explosion as soon as there is a target anywhere in sight and hold the cursor.
    # Fire: the moment the target is in range, deliver it and cast Energy Bolt on top.
    if var__engaged = 1 and var__armed = 0 and mana >= config__dump_mana and var__regs_explo = 1 and var__regs_eb = 1
        if not targetexists and not casting and cooldown "walk" = 0
            cast 'Explosion'

            for 25
                if targetexists
                    @setvar! var__armed 1
                    settimer "timer__arm" 0

                    if config__chatty = 1
                        overhead "[ explo, on ]" 90
                    endif

                    break
                endif

                if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                    break
                endif

                wait wait__poll
            endfor
        endif
    endif

    if var__armed = 1
        if not targetexists
            @setvar! var__armed 0
        elseif var__engaged = 1 and var__in_range = 1
            target var__target
            @setvar! var__armed 0

            # Delivering the held Explosion is a click, fine on the move. The Energy Bolt on top
            # is a cast, so it waits for the feet: if they are moving, the next pass arms again.
            if cooldown "walk" = 0 and mana >= config__mana_6th
                cast 'Energy Bolt'

                for 25
                    if targetexists
                        break
                    endif

                    if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                        break
                    endif

                    wait wait__poll
                endfor

                if targetexists
                    target var__target
                    wait wait__cast
                endif
            endif
        elseif timer "timer__arm" >= cooldown__arm
            hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
            @setvar! var__armed 0
            wait wait__short

            if config__chatty = 1
                overhead "[ explo, cut ]" 53
            endif
        endif
    endif

    wait wait__poll
endwhile
